age: age (simple, modern file encryption)
age:
age: age is a file encryption tool and format with small explicit keys,
age: no config options and UNIX-style composability. It encrypts to
age: X25519 recipients, SSH keys or passphrases, and supports plugins.
age:
age: This package installs the official statically-linked upstream
age: binary release: age, age-keygen, age-inspect and the age-plugin-*
age: helpers.
